@startuml HeteroClient_GPU_GDS_Simplified

' ============================================================================
' Simplified GPU Support with GPU Direct Storage (GDS)
' - Compile-time device selection (NPU OR GPU, not both)
' - Skip Remote H2D implementation (RH2D)
' - Use GPU Direct Storage (cuFileRead/cuFileWrite) instead of cudaMemcpyAsync
' ============================================================================

